  "description": "From the orphanage to becoming the boss's right-hand man, 'Gang-un' has worked hard to live up to the expectations of the organization's boss, 'William'.\n\nOne day, when William hands over his son, 'Isaac', who is returning from abroad, to Gang-un... \"What's so good about that old man that you're so loyal to him? Isn't a young person like me more attractive?\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/subdia), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/sub_dial), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000068219), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12267713), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1434022146)",
